hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"191","Koi shakhs apna maal dusre ke paas paye is ke bare mein: Harun ibn Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Mas'adah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij se, Ikrimah ibn Khalid se. Usaid ibn Hudair ibn Simak ne mujhe bayan kiya, Harun ne kaha: Ahmad yani Ibn Hanbal ne mujh se kaha: Un ki kitab mein, [yani Ibn Juraij ki kitab mein,] Usaid ibn Zuhair hai, lekin Basre mein unhon ne un se isi tarah bayan kiya, ke Hazrat Muawiyah Raziallahu anhu ne Marwan ko likha: Jab koi shakhs apni chori shuda cheez kisi shakhs ke haath mein paye to wo us ka zyada haqdar hai. To Marwan ne mujhe is ke bare mein likha jabke main Yamamah par tha, aur main ne use likha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne faisla farmaya ke jab wo use kisi aise shakhs ke haath mein paye jo muttaham na ho to agar chahe use utni qeemat par le le jitne mein wo kharida gaya tha, aur agar chahe apne chor ka peecha kare; aur aap ke baad Hazrat Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu aur Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu ne bhi isi tarah faisla farmaya. To Marwan ne mera khat Muawiyah ko bhej diya, aur Muawiyah ne Marwan ko likha: Na tum aur na Usaid mere zimme lagaye gaye muamle mein mere khilaf faisla karoge; balke main tum dono ke khilaf faisla karunga, pas jo main ne faisla kiya hai use nafiz karo. To Marwan ne Muawiyah ka khat mujhe bhej diya, aur Hazrat Usaid Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: [Hazrat Nabi] (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam), Hazrat Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu aur Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu ne isi tarah faisla farmaya tha; Allah ki qasam, main kabhi is ke khilaf faisla nahi karunga."
"192","Amr ibn Aun ne hum se bayan kiya, Hushaim ne humein khabar di, Musa ibn al-Sa'ib se, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Hazrat Samurah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apna asli maal kisi shakhs ke paas paye to wo us ka zyada haqdar hai, aur kharidar us ka peecha kare jis ne use becha tha."
